own\",\n    \"rocm\": \"7.2.4\",\n    \"sglang\": \"unknown\",\n    \"vllm\": \"0.28.0+rocm723\"\n  },\n  \"tp\": 1,\n  \"user_data_path\": \"/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/session\",\n  \"workload\": {\n    \"conc\": 64,\n    \"isl\": 1024,\n    \"max_model_len\": 6144,\n    \"osl\": 1024,\n    \"precision\": \"bf16\"\n  }\n}=== MODEL ARCH ===\n{\n  \"decoder_type\": \"dense (Qwen3_5, VL-wrapped ckpt -> serve text-only with --language-model-only)\",\n  \"attention\": \"hybrid GDN linear_attention + full_attention (1 of every 4 layers), GQA 24Q/4KV\",\n  \"layer_mix\": \"64 layers: 48 linear-attn (GDN) + 16 full-attn, full_attention_interval=4\",\n  \"kv_cache_per_token\": \"small (only 1/4 layers hold KV); block_size forced to ~848 tokens by mamba/GDN page alignment\",\n  \"active_params\": \"27B total\",\n  \"num_experts\": 0,\n  \"experts_per_tok\": 0,\n  \"mtp\": \"not built into 0.28.0+rocm723 here; fused_gdn_decode_post_conv_mtp falls back to Triton GDN (verified non-bottleneck)\",\n  \"norm\": \"rmsnorm\",\n  \"notes\": \"gfx90a/MI250X PLATFORM LAWS (measured on this box, 2026-09, see /home/qiba/ai docs): (1) AITER INT8 a8w8 ScaledMM LINEAR is VALIDATED and FAST on gfx90a - VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER=1 + VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER_LINEAR=1 select AiterInt8ScaledMMLinearKernel; 'not found tuned config in a8w8_tuned_gemm.csv -> default' is CORRECT behavior, do not chase tuned tables. (2) AITER fused-MoE is DEAD on gfx90a (CK 2-stage bf16 stage2 silently writes zeros; CDNA2 lacks global_atomic_pk_add_bf16). Never propose enabling aiter MoE. Triton fused MoE is optimal for MoE models. (3) FP8/FP4 compute physically absent (no FP8 ALU). fp8-KV storage is UNRELIABLE on 0.28.0+rocm723 (silent fallback/crash) - do not propose --kv-cache-dtype fp8. (4) NEVER enable custom allreduce (use_custom_allreduce) on gfx90a: silently corrupts output ('!!!'). Keep PYNCCL. (5) MoE/INT8 tuned-config seed tables measured WORSE than defaults on this box (A/B) - do not propose them as wins. (6) INT8 and BF16 have equal peak (181) on CDNA2; a8w8 wins via scheduling maturity (~2.9x vs Triton INT8). (7) --safetensors-load-strategy eager is REQUIRED here (loader silently dies without it on this storage). (8) Speculative decoding (dflash) tokens/step is a function of prompt style: random-token benchmark corpora collapse acceptance; measured random-prompt numbers CANNOT judge spec-decode levers. (9) Random-token Magpie corpus IS valid for GEMM/config/graph levers. (10) One MI250X die == one MI210 (gfx90a/104CU/64GiB): INT8 W8A8 27B single-die BF16-out serving hits ~80 tok/s single-stream WITH dflash on natural prose, ~50-65 without; TP=1 preferred for 27B-class weights (no cross-die comm).\"\n}\n=== PATCHES DIR ===\npatches/:\ntotal 8\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root 4096 Sep 14 13:49 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 19 root root 4096 Sep 14 14:09 ..\n\nruns/:\ntotal 36\ndrwxr-xr-x  9 root root 4096 Sep 14 13:51 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 19 root root 4096 Sep 14 14:09 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root 4096 Sep 14 13:49 backends\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 root root 4096 Sep 14 13:49 baseline\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root 4096 Sep 14 13:49 integrate\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root 4096 Sep 14 13:49 kernel_opt\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root 4096 Sep 14 13:49 params\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root 4096 Sep 14 13:49 profile\ndrwxr-xr-x  5 root root 4096 Sep 14 14:10 specialist\nShell cwd was reset to /home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/session/Qwen3.8-27B-ABLITERATED-W8A8-gdnint8/20260914T134902Z-244d9455/runs/specialist/b8dc969b654d45e2a1e07acf784a2a4e","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d04e817-22bd-4007-8bfe-16ebd866a617","uuid":"6295fdd9-96ea-4dd5-8a2c-d84c1db8317e","timestamp":"2026-09-14T14:11:21.743Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"claw_session_id\": null,\n  \"code_revision\": \"\",\n  \"created_at_utc\": \"2026-09-14T13:49:02+00:00\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"inferencex\": {\n      \"commit\": \"3d55815\",\n      \"path\": \"/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/.cache/InferenceX@3d5581562f643f9bdeb8410cd924e2c70906c966\",