{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_8f39bc54653f4389","type":"tool_result","content":"---\nlicense: apache-2.0\nbase_model: Blackfrost-AI/Qwen3.8-27B-ABLITERATED-BF16\nbase_model_relation: quantized\nlibrary_name: vllm\ntags:\n- qwen3_5\n- qwen3.8\n- compressed-tensors\n- w8a8\n- int8\n- abliterated\n- gfx90a\n- mi210\n- rocm\n---\n\n# Qwen3.8-27B abliterated — W8A8 + INT8 GDN projections + INT8 lm_head\n\nINT8 `W8A8` quantization of [Blackfrost-AI/Qwen3.8-27B-ABLITERATED-BF16](https://huggingface.co/Blackfrost-AI/Qwen3.8-27B-ABLITERATED-BF16),\nitself an abliterated derivative of `Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B`. **Abliterated models have had\nrefusal behaviour deliberately removed; that property is inherited here unchanged.**\n\nProduced and measured on a **single AMD MI210 (gfx90a / CDNA2)**.\n\n## What is different from a normal W8A8 of this model\n\nTwo things are quantized beyond a normal W8A8 build of this model:\n\n**1. The three large gated-delta-net (GDN) projections** — `in_proj_qkv`, `in_proj_z`,\n`out_proj` — across all 48 `linear_attention` layers. **That is a deliberate departure\nfrom the usual recipe for this architecture, which protects the whole linear-attention\npath as quantization-sensitive.** Read the evaluation section; a plain W8A8 build is the\nconservative choice.\n\n**2. `lm_head`** (248,320 x 5,120). This one is close to free — see below.\n\nMeasured on one MI210, decode:\n\n| | W8A8 baseline | + GDN int8 | + lm_head int8 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| MTP N=1 | 40.5 tok/s | 50.0 | **57.2** |\n| per forward step | 43.68 ms | 35.68 | **32.10 ms** |\n| with dflash spec (N=12) | — | — | **81.3 tok/s** |\n| KV cache capacity | 298,381 tok | 374,711 | **374,711** (+26%) |\n| on disk | 35 GB | 30 GB | **28 GB** |\n\nThe GDN projections were 5.54 B parameters sitting in BF16 — 11.07 GB read every decode\nstep against 19.3 GB for everything already quantized, i.e. ~30% of kernel time in one\nunquantized tensor family. `lm_head` was another 2.54 GB in a single call.\n\n## What is quantized\n\nEverything the parent W8A8 recipe quantizes (MLPs on all 64 layers, `self_attn`\nprojections on the 16 `full_attention` layers), **plus**:\n\n| added here | count | |\n|---|---|---|\n| `linear_attn.in_proj_qkv` | 48 | 10240x5120 |\n| `linear_attn.in_proj_z` | 48 | 6144x5120 |\n=== config.json head ===\narchitectures ['Qwen3_5ForConditionalGeneration']\nmodel_type qwen3_5\nquant {\"config_groups\": {\"group_0\": {\"format\": \"int-quantized\", \"input_activations\": {\"actorder\": null, \"block_structure\": null, \"dynamic\": true, \"group_size\": null, \"num_bits\": 8, \"observer\": null, \"observer_kwargs\": {}, \"scale_dtype\": null, \"strategy\": \"token\", \"symmetric\": true, \"type\": \"int\", \"zp_dtype\": null}, \"output_activations\": null, \"targets\": [\"Linear\", \"re:.*lm_head$\"], \"weights\": {\"actorder\": null, \"block_structure\": null, \"dynamic\": false, \"group_size\": null, \"num_bits\": 8, \"observer\": \"memoryless_minmax\", \"observer_kwargs\": {}, \"scale_dtype\": null, \"strategy\": \"channel\", \"symmetric\": \ntext arch None qwen3_5_text layers 64","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d04e817-22bd-4007-8bfe-16ebd866a617","uuid":"ce352ff4-79f5-4eaa-b08c-fa4a9d55c819","timestamp":"2026-09-14T14:47:20.291Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"---\nlicense: apache-2.0\nbase_model: Blackfrost-AI/Qwen3.8-27B-ABLITERATED-BF16\nbase_model_relation: quantized\nlibrary_name: vllm\ntags:\n- qwen3_5\n- qwen3.8\n- compressed-tensors\n- w8a8\n- int8\n- abliterated\n- gfx90a\n- mi210\n- rocm\n---\n\n# Qwen3.8-27B abliterated — W8A8 + INT8 GDN projections + INT8 lm_head\n\nINT8 `W8A8` quantization of [Blackfrost-AI/Qwen3.8-27B-ABLITERATED-BF16](https://huggingface.co/Blackfrost-AI/Qwen3.8-27B-ABLITERATED-BF16),\nitself an abliterated derivative of `Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B`. **Abliterated models have had\nrefusal behaviour deliberately removed; that property is inherited here unchanged.**\n\nProduced and measured on a **single AMD MI210 (gfx90a / CDNA2)**.\n\n## What is different from a normal W8A8 of this model\n\nTwo things are quantized beyond a normal W8A8 build of this model:\n\n**1. The three large gated-delta-net (GDN) projections** — `in_proj_qkv`, `in_proj_z`,\n`out_proj` — across all 48 `linear_attention` layers. **That is a deliberate departure\nfrom the usual recipe for this architecture, which protects the whole linear-attention\npath as quantization-sensitive.** Read the evaluation section; a plain W8A8 build is the\nconservative choice.\n\n**2. `lm_head`** (248,320 x 5,120). This one is close to free — see below.\n\nMeasured on one MI210, decode:\n\n| | W8A8 baseline | + GDN int8 | + lm_head int8 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| MTP N=1 | 40.5 tok/s | 50.0 | **57.2** |\n| per forward step | 43.68 ms | 35.68 | **32.10 ms** |\n| with dflash spec (N=12) | — | — | **81.3 tok/s** |\n| KV cache capacity | 298,381 tok | 374,711 | **374,711** (+26%) |\n| on disk | 35 GB | 30 GB | **28 GB** |\n\nThe GDN projections were 5.54 B parameters sitting in BF16 — 11.07 GB read every decode\nstep against 19.3 GB for everything already quantized, i.e. ~30% of kernel time in one\nunquantized tensor family. `lm_head` was another 2.54 GB in a single call.\n\n## What is quantized\n\nEverything the parent W8A8 recipe quantizes (MLPs on all 64 layers, `self_attn`\nprojections on the 16 `full_attention` layers), **plus**:\n\n| added here | count | |\n|---|---|---|\n| `linear_attn.in_proj_qkv` | 48 | 10240x5120 |\n| `linear_attn.in_proj_z` | 48 | 6144x5120 |\n=== config.json head ===\narchitectures ['Qwen3_5ForConditionalGeneration']\nmodel_type qwen3_5\nquant {\"config_groups\": {\"group_0\": {\"format\": \"int-quantized\", \"input_activations\": {\"actorder\": null, \"block_structure\": null, \"dynamic\": true, \"group_size\": null, \"num_bits\": 8, \"observer\": null, \"observer_kwargs\": {}, \"scale_dtype\": null, \"strategy\": \"token\", \"symmetric\": true, \"type\": \"int\", \"zp_dtype\": null}, \"output_activations\": null, \"targets\": [\"Linear\", \"re:.*lm_head$\"], \"weights\": {\"actorder\": null, \"block_structure\": null, \"dynamic\": false, \"group_size\": null, \"num_bits\": 8, \"observer\": \"memoryless_minmax\", \"observer_kwargs\": {}, \"scale_dtype\": null, \"strategy\": \"channel\", \"symmetric\": \ntext arch None qwen3_5_text layers 64","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
